{"verse_key": "13:23", "surah": 13, "verse": 23, "text_uthmani": "جَنَّـٰتُ عَدْنٍ يَدْخُلُونَهَا وَمَن صَلَحَ مِنْ ءَابَآئِهِمْ وَأَزْوَٰجِهِمْ وَذُرِّيَّـٰتِهِمْ ۖ وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ يَدْخُلُونَ عَلَيْهِم مِّن كُلِّ بَابٍ", "translation": "Gardens of perpetual residence; they will enter them with whoever were righteous among their forefathers, their spouses and their descendants. And the angels will enter upon them from every gate, [saying],", "verse_from_ms": 589430, "verse_to_ms": 612420, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "جَنَّـٰتُ", "start_ms": 589430, "end_ms": 591220}, {"i": 1, "text": "عَدْنٍ", "start_ms": 591220, "end_ms": 592470}, {"i": 2, "text": "يَدْخُلُونَهَا", "start_ms": 592470, "end_ms": 593990}, {"i": 3, "text": "وَمَن", "start_ms": 593990, "end_ms": 594940}, {"i": 4, "text": "صَلَحَ", "start_ms": 594940, "end_ms": 595690}, {"i": 5, "text": "مِنْ", "start_ms": 595690, "end_ms": 595990}, {"i": 6, "text": "ءَابَآئِهِمْ", "start_ms": 595990, "end_ms": 599000}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَأَزْوَٰجِهِمْ", "start_ms": 599000, "end_ms": 600610}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَذُرِّيَّـٰتِهِمْ", "start_ms": 600610, "end_ms": 602590}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 602590, "end_ms": 605820}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ", "start_ms": 605820, "end_ms": 606940}, {"i": 11, "text": "يَدْخُلُونَ", "start_ms": 606940, "end_ms": 608100}, {"i": 12, "text": "عَلَيْهِم", "start_ms": 608100, "end_ms": 609300}, {"i": 13, "text": "مِّن", "start_ms": 609300, "end_ms": 609800}, {"i": 14, "text": "كُلِّ", "start_ms": 609800, "end_ms": 612285}, {"i": 15, "text": "بَابٍ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}